---
title: "env_resolution (Docker Deployment Configuration)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_read_env: read .env file
    q_read_env --> q_parse: parse key-value pairs
    q_read_env --> q_error: .env file not found
    q_error --> [*]: fail deployment
    q_parse --> q_inject_file_vars: inject env_file variables
    q_inject_file_vars --> q_check_override: check environment block
    q_check_override --> q_apply_override: NODE_ENV defined in environment
    q_apply_override --> q_final_env: NODE_ENV = production (overrides .env)
    q_final_env --> [*]: environment ready

    note right of q_check_override
        INV-001: Docker Compose environment block takes precedence over env_file
        INV-002: Only NODE_ENV is explicitly overridden to production
    end note

    note right of q_read_env
        INV-003: .env file may contain secrets (API keys, tokens, DB credentials)
        INV-004: .env file should not be committed to version control
    end note
